450,"currency":"USD","limit":null,"remaining":null,"backers":5,"available":true,"estimated_delivery":"2027-10","shipping":"Anywhere in the world","items":["Amoeba One Device ×5"],"description":"Five phones, your colors.\n\nChoose your color after campaign via backer tools, all colors available."}],"add_ons":[{"minimum":1,"currency":"USD","description":"Add-on to any reward. 4G, physical SIM. $1 Kickstarter exclusive price on the $15 a month plan.","limit":null,"remaining":null}],"story_text":"## The phone\nAmoeba One. A keychain dumb phone with a clip-on carabiner and rotating camera.\nA mini phone for calls, texts, maps, rides, music and banking. No social feeds.\n## Colors\nY2K color. Silicone colorways, glass screen, stainless steel inner core.\nFive swirls: Mango Orange, Berry Swirl, Cotton Candy, Lagoon Swirl, Lime Soda.\n## Features\n360-degree swiveling pop-out camera for front and rear photos.\nBuilt-in carabiner. Clips to keys, bag or belt loop.\n## Everyday\nA first phone. Calls, texts, maps and practical tools, no social feed apps.\nBring your own SIM, 100+ carriers worldwide, or choose the low-cost Amoeba plan.\n## Under the hood\n4+32GB, 1000 mAh battery, custom Android based OS, 4G physical SIM, Bluetooth, WiFi, USB-C.\n## Spiky and Weirdoz\nSpiky Amoeba. The same mini phone in a spiked silicone shell.\nWeirdoz. A surprise color with a chance at rare and unreleased Amoebas.\n## Prices\nAmoeba One: $99 Super Early Bird, $110 Early Bird, $119 campaign price.\nSilicone shell, stainless steel core, glass touchscreen, carabiner ring.\n## Development\n## Schedule and funding\nCampaign Oct 13 to Nov 13, 2026. Phones ship Oct 2027.\n## Amoeba Tech\nEarly proof: $10,000 startup competition funding, New York Business Plan Competition finalist, design patent awarded.\nAmoeba Tech, Inc. Upstate NY. Maker of Amoeba One, a keychain-sized minimalist smartphone.","story_images":["https://i.kickstarter.com/assets/055/490/181/5f3bfd190e487e92007ce8850e14ea1a_original.jp